@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy policy";
    Layout = "_LayoutNoFooter";
}

<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>Lamazon stores two cookies in your browser:</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Lamazon.Auth</strong>: keeps you logged in (for one hour after your last visit).</li>
    <li><strong>Lamazon.ShoppingCart</strong>: the ids of the products in your shopping cart (for two days).</li>
</ul>
<p>When you place an order, we save your IP address and the country it belongs to.</p>
